WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.760
Last year IBM and Telefonica teamed up to&nbsp;
create the first version of Cloud Garden,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.881
a revolutionary platform that allows large&nbsp;
enterprises and government bodies

00:00:19.881 --> 00:00:22.369
to accelerate their digital transformation.

00:00:22.369 --> 00:00:24.998
This was done&nbsp;using the latest technologies

00:00:24.998 --> 00:00:27.615
in containers, artificial intelligence and blockchain.

00:00:31.505 --> 00:00:33.959
Now we&nbsp;are bringing another partner on board

00:00:33.959 --> 00:00:36.137
to take another major leap forward.

00:00:36.137 --> 00:00:39.896
We are incorporating&nbsp;Red Hat via its OpenShift platform

00:00:39.896 --> 00:00:43.476
which will make moving to containers an even simpler task.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.388
Cloud Garden's future is and must be multi-cloud.

00:00:46.388 --> 00:00:50.100
Our customers need to use the cloud that&nbsp;
best matches their use cases,

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.143
which vary depending on parameters

00:00:52.143 --> 00:00:56.543
such as security,&nbsp;compliance, cost, and proximity to the process.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:06.000
A shift towards container environments is the only&nbsp; effective way of making this transfer of loads.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
It enables us to create much more&nbsp;
resilient open architectures at an&nbsp;even lower cost.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.389
With Cloud Garden,&nbsp;we take care of the platform so that you, the customers,

00:01:16.389 --> 00:01:21.138
only have&nbsp;to concern yourselves with the really important aspect of the business application

00:01:21.138 --> 00:01:24.340
to&nbsp;ensure effective transformation within companies.

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:34.400
We can do this because of the high level of&nbsp;
integration with other telephone services&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:38.505
and, above all, because of&nbsp;
integration with communications.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:43.120
We are backed in this service by major&nbsp;
partners such as IBM and Red Hat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:49.365
whose Cloud Pak and OpenShift technologies enable&nbsp;
us to help customers take that step.

00:01:49.365 --> 00:01:55.302
Cloud Garden is Telefonica's platform for transforming&nbsp;
your applications using open architecture.

